<title>USA: Dow gains more than 50 points.</title>
<headline>Dow gains more than 50 points.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average gained more than 50 points in late afternoon trading Tuesday, propelled by a rally in bonds and good quarterly earnings.</p>
<p>At 3:32 p.m. EDT, the Dow index was up 50.17 points at 7,973.15, which activated the New York Stock Exchange's limits on program trading.</p>
